  "title": "Laurie's Shepherd's Pie",
  "description": "This savory beef pie is so easy to make and is one of my husband's favorites. The leftovers are perfect for lunch the next day. For added flavor, you could top the potatoes with a cup of shredded Cheddar cheese, if desired.",
  "authors": [
    "PHEBES"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-04-17T14:44:53-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-07-14T15:54:41-04:00",
